config-connector-extensions patch 0035: mockgcp serves Cloud DNS response policy rules.

mockdns registered no ResponsePolicyRulesServer, so every rule request
was a 404 from the mux (found writing DNSResponsePolicyRule). The rules
are kept per policy: create (the rule's name in the body), get, update
(replace), patch (the fields set), delete and list. A rule of a missing
policy is 404 and a rule without a DNS name 400, as Cloud DNS answers.

